WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Build Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Build Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.600
Step 2: Walk round and build by hand. Pick a block, click to place it. W A S D to walk, F to fly.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:21.000
Step 3: Code it and press Run. Builder blocks build right / up / ahead of where you stand.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.200
Step 4: See it as Python. The Python tab is the same program, and edits turn back into blocks.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.600
Step 5: Type a chat command. tower 6 runs “when I type tower”, with the 6 in a variable.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.800
Step 6: Open a ready-made world. Worlds: the Robot Helper Academy lessons and example worlds.
